# Project-local scout-block overrides for SLTerm.
#
# This repo's release pipeline writes its Go binaries, the electron-vite output,
# and the packaged installers into dist/ and build/, so packaging work has to be
# able to name those paths. node_modules is unblocked so the project-local
# toolchain (tsc, electron-builder, vite) can be invoked directly.
#
# Everything else in the shipped baseline still applies.

!dist
!build
!node_modules
